    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d98">

                <pb facs="0104" n="94" sameAs="frus:frus1944v04/pg94"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">811.20 Defense (M) Portugal/1434a: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State
                        to the Minister in Portugal</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Norweb</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1944-02-24T11:00:00-04:00">February 24,
                            1944—11 a.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>539. Department and FEA indorse your suggestion that in company with your British
                    colleague you now approach Salazar with a request for a temporary embargo on
                    wolfram exports.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Stettinius</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
